    <div style="background:#2a1426;border-left:4px solid #ec4899;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:9px;margin:14px 0;">
    <p style="margin:0 0 6px 0;color:#f9a8d4;font-weight:bold;">🤔 Pause and Think</p>
    <div style="margin:0;">Why is tan 90° undefined? tan θ = opp ÷ adj. As θ gets close to 90°, the adjacent side shrinks towards 0, and dividing by 0 is impossible.</div>
    </div>
