    <div style="background:#1e293b;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:20px;border:1px solid #334155;">
    <h3 style="color:#7dd3fc;margin-top:0;">📖 Glossary</h3>
    <div style="overflow-x:auto;margin:12px 0;">
    <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;color:#f1f5f9;">
    <tr style="background:#334155;">
    <th style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #475569;text-align:left;">Term</th>
    <th style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #475569;text-align:left;">Meaning</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #475569;vertical-align:top;"><strong style="color:#fde68a;">Mutually exclusive</strong>
    </td>
    <td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #475569;vertical-align:top;">Events that cannot happen together.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="background:#172033;">
    <td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #475569;vertical-align:top;"><strong style="color:#fde68a;">Independent events</strong>
    </td>
    <td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #475569;vertical-align:top;">Events that do not affect each other.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #475569;vertical-align:top;"><strong style="color:#fde68a;">Addition rule</strong>
    </td>
    <td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #475569;vertical-align:top;">P(A or B) = P(A) + P(B) for mutually exclusive events.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="background:#172033;">
    <td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #475569;vertical-align:top;"><strong style="color:#fde68a;">Multiplication rule</strong>
    </td>
    <td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #475569;vertical-align:top;">P(A and B) = P(A) × P(B) for independent events.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
    <td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #475569;vertical-align:top;"><strong style="color:#fde68a;">Tree diagram</strong>
    </td>
    <td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #475569;vertical-align:top;">Branching diagram of outcomes and probabilities.</td>
    </tr>
    </table>
    </div>
    </div>
